    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289040/extras/d4a8d4674c7249167d49682e24d9e33d.avif?t=1739463848\" /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Explore a desolate lonely world, find your way &amp; collect lies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289040/extras/3ab8b191574523a45fbb3748c8b9e6c6.avif?t=1739463848\" /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Adopt psychological personalities and battle inner demons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289040/extras/bbffcc06b7a6769a29be2cd3978af8be.avif?t=1739463848\" /></span>Discover &amp;  use a plethora of strange items &amp; Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological RPG horror with an implied silent story for players to contemplate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based combat with obscured hardcore mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange items and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weirdness.</p>",
